      "created_at": "2015-01-12T13:16:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It does not say that a hero may not use the power twice, but that the power itself may not be used twice in the same turn. &nbsp;Note this is turn, not round, so as long as Guise can restrain himself from playing I can do that too on Legacy's turn, or any number of other power granting abilities can refrain from using it Legacy can use it on his turn.</p><p>Just have to organize you throwdown to not stop your allies from helping you rock.</p>",
