      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/dbc845/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-13T09:29:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So would I be correct in assuming that if say, Argent Adept uses Inspiring Supertonic on his turn on Haka causing Haka to use the power on Mere than Haka could use the &nbsp;Mere on his turn (because it's a new turn)? Whereas if someone has the Captain Cosmic card which lets them use a power at the start of their turn that they couldn't use the same power at the start of turn and then during their power phase (because it's still the same turn)?</p>",
